<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Osas Arena AI</title>
<style>
body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background: #101020;
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
}
header {
    background: #252044;
    padding: 25px;
}
h1 {
    color: gold;
    font-size: 30px;
}
.container {
    padding: 30px 15px;
}
.box {
    background: #24243d;
    padding: 20px;
    margin: 20px auto;
    border-radius: 15px;
    max-width: 450px;
}
button {
    background: gold;
    color: black;
    border: none;
    padding: 14px 22px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 16px;
    margin: 8px;
}
textarea {
    width: 90%;
    height: 120px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 10px;
}
footer {
    padding: 20px;
    color: #ccc;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
<h1>👑 OSAS ARENA AI</h1>
<p>Your imagination, your story, your movie!</p>
</header>

<div class="container">

<div class="box">
<h2>🎬 Create Your AI Story</h2>
<p>Write your own story and bring your imagination to life.</p>
<textarea placeholder="Write your story here..."></textarea>
<br>
<button onclick="alert('Story creator coming soon!')">Create My Story</button>
</div>

<div class="box">
<h2>🎥 AI Video Creator</h2>
<p>Turn your creative ideas into amazing videos.</p>
<button onclick="alert('AI video generator coming soon!')">Generate Video</button>
</div>

<div class="box">
<h2>📖 My Story Studio</h2>
<p>Your home for creative stories and movies.</p>
</div>

</div>

<footer>
<p>Created with love by Osas Arena</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
